    <briefdescription>
<para>Machine-readable contract describing error conditions, severity, and recovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used in API documentation to specify:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>When an error occurs (preconditions/postconditions)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>What will be logged (diagnostic information)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>How to recover (fallback strategies)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Downstream impact (who is affected)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>This is the &quot;machine-readable&quot; complement to @error_contract Doxygen tags. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
